cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Moonshine in research, please cite this software."
title: "Moonshine: a Kimi K3.1 Pro research-preview inference engine for AMD Strix Halo"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Moonshine contributors"
version: "0.3.0-k3.1-research-preview"
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/outerreaches/moonshine"
abstract: >-
  An experimental single-node SafeTensors/ROCm inference-engine cutover for the
  pinned Kimi K3.1 Pro checkpoint, with BF16 Gated DSA and NVMe-streamed routed
  experts. Real generation, state recovery, and natural-context retrieval pass
  through 64K tokens; production deployment and longer contexts are not yet
  qualified.
keywords:
  - Kimi K3.1 Pro
  - ROCm
  - Strix Halo
  - sparse attention
  - mixture of experts
  - inference
